## Fonts
cask "font-fira-code"
cask "font-monaspace"
cask "font-symbols-only-nerd-font"
cask "font-jetbrains-mono-nerd-font"  # v3 Nerd Font — Rio + NvChad devicons need v3 glyphs
cask "font-hack"   # plain Hack; installed here but was undeclared
# "Hack Nerd Font Mono" is the family .config/ghostty/config and
# .config/rio/config.toml actually name, and font-hack above does NOT provide it
# (it ships only Hack-Regular/Bold/Italic). The faces currently resolve from
# hand-installed files in ~/Library/Fonts named "Hack * Nerd Font Complete*.ttf"
# — that's Nerd Font v2 naming, dropped in v3. So a fresh box gets no Nerd Hack
# at all, and this box has only v2 glyph coverage. Declared for reproducibility;
# NOT installed yet, because adding v3 faces beside the v2 files would register
# two fonts claiming the same family name. Remove the v2 files first, then
# `brew install --cask font-hack-nerd-font`.
cask "font-hack-nerd-font"
